  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Area</strong> 60-foot aura</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The bearer and allies in the aura receive @UUID[Compendium.astillon-hanaq-adventures-module.astillon-blaster-items.Item.BlasterInspire01]{Inspire}.</p><p>Drag onto any actor. The GM can edit the radius, targets, benefit, and duration freely. This manually placed aura is not subject to the module's summoned-thrall restrictions or cleanup.</p><p>The module totals overlapping Flash Mob auras on each recipient. Distinct auras stack, including 10 temporary HP per Bolster source (less damage already spent). Leaving a Bolster aura hides its remaining contribution; re-entry restores only the unspent remainder.</p>",
